   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2024_IBSA_Empowering Women and Youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to increase the scale of vegetable production for smallholder &#xb7; farmers. It is a follow-up to the past implemented project targeting women in Juba, and this will enable women-led vegetable producer groups to increase production, improve the quality of produce, and market the produce, thus stabilizing the food and nutrition security and income of the smallholder farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
